{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"Y\",\n  \"regress\": \"有，Y的音乐感受描写明显不如X细腻具体，许多声音层次、旋律变化和情绪转折被压缩成了概括性词语，也失去了一部分与音乐小节同步出现的体验。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"Y\",\n    \"point\": \"X\",\n    \"why\": \"Y\",\n    \"whole\": \"Y\",\n    \"fine\": \"X\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"Y的完整叙述更容易让普通观众顺着读懂人物的动机、矛盾和心理变化，左右分栏也让故事与感受各有位置；X用【】突出关键点很有效，但感受信息过于密集，容易让扫屏变成不断处理文字。X在音乐细节和情绪质感上确实更丰富，尤其是声音的变化、情绪的微妙转折以及具体的听觉联想，但综合考虑边听边看的体验，Y更容易让人理解并记住这是一段怎样的心路历程。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "fcd347c6-3df4-460b-a66b-465492ccbe3f", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261107T182251625394Z", "elapsed_seconds": 89.25, "completed_utc": "2026-11-07T18:24:20.888696+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "4f8088866bc1a6106fefe3bb7ecf8fe9197697dc4edd02626427d2382cf40d4d", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_